{"channelId":"UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA","row":["BigCatDerek",147000,"Hi, my name is Derek and I'm the resident unofficial attention-seeker for the Center for Animal Research and Education (CARE), a non-profit big cat sanctuary in Texas. \n\nI've been working with big cats for over 15 years, and my wife, Heidi, is CARE's Founder & Executive Director. She's a pretty cool lady. Since CARE is a non-profit, I don't \"own\" any of the cats shown in my videos, but I think of them as my dearest friends, my babies.\n\nAnyway, hope you like the vids!\n\n-Derek","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:18:43.477Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:18:43.477Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/bigcatderek","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":47765,"raw":"47765","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/bigcatderek/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:33:47.456Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":147000,"raw":"147K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:15.121Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC10bxQVVz1dJSIUC-f5hJdA"]}]}